    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llClearCameraParams();`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Resets all camera parameters to default values and turns off scripted camera control.</p>
  <p>To run this function the script must request the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PERMISSION_CONTROL_CAMERA" target="_blank">PERMISSION_CONTROL_CAMERA</a> permission with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlRequestPermissions" target="_blank">llRequestPermissions</a>.</p>
</p>
    </div>

